contentText:
Anuel AA is finally releasing his highly-anticipated new album, RHLM2 , on his birthday, Nov. 26.&nbsp;

The forthcoming set, which is a follow-up to his debut album Real Hasta La Muerte released in 2018, will have tracks that blend trap and reggaetón, and marks a return to his origins, as he exclusively revealed during the exclusive Superstar Q&A and Premiere Party at Billboard Latin Music Week in October.&nbsp;

